items.CozyRanch_Rabbit_Fluff.name=Rabbit Fluff
items.CozyRanch_Rabbit_Fluff.description=Soft fluff from your rabbits. Spin two into a Cotton Scrap at the Furniture Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Seed_Pouch.name=Seed Pouch
items.CozyRanch_Seed_Pouch.description=A pouch of seeds your mice tucked away. Use it to open it into three random crop seeds.
items.CozyRanch_Mixed_Nuts.name=Mixed Nuts
items.CozyRanch_Mixed_Nuts.description=Acorns, hazelnuts and walnuts from your squirrels. A small snack, or mix into Trail Mix at the Cooking Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Sea_Shell.name=Sea Shell
items.CozyRanch_Sea_Shell.description=A pretty shell your crabs found. Two make a beach decoration at the Furniture Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Goat_Hair.name=Goat Hair
items.CozyRanch_Goat_Hair.description=Coarse hair from your goats. Spin two into a Linen Scrap at the Furniture Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Moss_Tuft.name=Moss Tuft
items.CozyRanch_Moss_Tuft.description=Rich moss from your mosshorns. Use it on a growing crop to grow it one stage, or make mossy blocks at the Farming Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Turkey_Feather.name=Turkey Feather
items.CozyRanch_Turkey_Feather.description=A long tail feather from your turkeys. Fletch eight arrows with one at the Workbench.
items.CozyRanch_Duck_Egg.name=Duck Egg
items.CozyRanch_Duck_Egg.description=A big egg from your ducks, worth two hen eggs in dough. Fry it on a campfire or make a Truffle Omelette.
items.CozyRanch_Truffle.name=Truffle
items.CozyRanch_Truffle.description=An earthy treasure your pigs snuffled up. Cook it as a mushroom, or make a Truffle Omelette at the Cooking Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Fried_Duck_Egg.name=Fried Duck Egg
items.CozyRanch_Fried_Duck_Egg.description=A duck egg fried on a campfire. Heals and slowly mends you.
items.CozyRanch_Truffle_Omelette.name=Truffle Omelette
items.CozyRanch_Truffle_Omelette.description=A rolled omelette with cheese and truffle. A hearty meal that mends you and raises your health.
items.CozyRanch_Trail_Mix.name=Trail Mix
items.CozyRanch_Trail_Mix.description=Nuts and fruit for the road. Mends you and gives you more stamina.
seed_pouch.opened=You open the pouch and find {count} seeds.
moss_tuft.grown=This crop is fully grown already.
items.CozyRanch_Fox_Trinket.name=Fox Trinket
items.CozyRanch_Fox_Trinket.description=A knotted bundle of odds and ends your fox hoarded. Use it to unwrap one find: a metal bar, leather, studs, feathers or bones.
items.CozyRanch_Wolf_Fur.name=Wolf Fur
items.CozyRanch_Wolf_Fur.description=Thick grey fur from your wolves. Tan two into Medium Leather at the Tannery.
items.CozyRanch_Wild_Honey.name=Wild Honey
items.CozyRanch_Wild_Honey.description=Honeycomb your bear brought home. A sweet snack that mends you, and the heart of a Honey Cake.
items.CozyRanch_Spotted_Pelt.name=Spotted Pelt
items.CozyRanch_Spotted_Pelt.description=Soft spotted fur from your snow leopards. Three make a Spotted Rug at the Furniture Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Shed_Antler.name=Shed Antler
items.CozyRanch_Shed_Antler.description=An antler your deer shed. Hang two on an Antler Mount at the Furniture Bench, or break one into bone fragments at the Workbench.
items.CozyRanch_Bison_Wool.name=Bison Wool
items.CozyRanch_Bison_Wool.description=A thick bundle of bison wool. Each one spins into a Wool Scrap at the Furniture Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Tortoise_Scute.name=Tortoise Scute
items.CozyRanch_Tortoise_Scute.description=A shell plate your tortoise shed. Hard as Sturdy Chitin, and turns into one at the Workbench.
items.CozyRanch_Shiny_Pebble.name=Shiny Pebble
items.CozyRanch_Shiny_Pebble.description=A glittering pebble your meerkats dug up. Use it to crack it open and find ore, or a crystal if you are lucky.
items.CozyRanch_Honey_Cake.name=Honey Cake
items.CozyRanch_Honey_Cake.description=A soft sponge glazed with wild honey. A rich treat that mends you and gives you more stamina.
items.CozyRanch_Spotted_Rug.name=Spotted Rug
items.CozyRanch_Spotted_Rug.description=A cosy rug of snow leopard fur, two blocks long.
items.CozyRanch_Antler_Mount.name=Antler Mount
items.CozyRanch_Antler_Mount.description=A pair of shed antlers on an oak plaque. Hang it on a wall.
find.opened=You find {count} {item}.
fox_trinket.opened=You unwrap the trinket and find {count} {item}.
shiny_pebble.opened=You crack the pebble open and find {count} {item}.
items.CozyRanch_Pond_Weed.name=Pond Weed
items.CozyRanch_Pond_Weed.description=A wet clump of waterweed from your moose. Six with poop and life essence compost into Fertilizer at the Farming Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Armadillo_Plate.name=Armadillo Plate
items.CozyRanch_Armadillo_Plate.description=A banded shell plate your armadillo shed. Four face an Armadillo Shield at the Armour Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Penguin_Down.name=Penguin Down
items.CozyRanch_Penguin_Down.description=Soft, warm down from your penguins. Stuff a Village Bed or a Frozen Castle Bed with it at the Furniture Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Warthog_Tusk.name=Warthog Tusk
items.CozyRanch_Warthog_Tusk.description=A curved tusk from your warthogs. Counts as bone, and four make Bone Daggers at the Weapon Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Antelope_Horn.name=Antelope Horn
items.CozyRanch_Antelope_Horn.description=A ringed horn your antelope shed. Make a Herding Horn at the Workbench, or a Swiftness Tonic at the Alchemy Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Shed_Skin.name=Shed Skin
items.CozyRanch_Shed_Skin.description=The papery skin your gecko shed. With water essence it brews a Fireward Tonic at the Alchemy Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Pigeon_Feather.name=Pigeon Feather
items.CozyRanch_Pigeon_Feather.description=A soft grey feather from your pigeons. Three with life essence brew a Pigeon Morph potion at the Alchemy Bench.
items.CozyRanch_Herding_Horn.name=Herding Horn
items.CozyRanch_Herding_Horn.description=Blow it and your animals within 32 blocks come and follow you.
items.CozyRanch_Armadillo_Shield.name=Armadillo Shield
items.CozyRanch_Armadillo_Shield.description=An oak shield faced with armadillo plates. As tough as an iron shield.
items.CozyRanch_Feather_Vase.name=Feather Vase
items.CozyRanch_Feather_Vase.description=A glazed vase holding a fan of red feathers, such as your flamingos bring.
items.CozyRanch_Tonic_Fireward.name=Fireward Tonic
items.CozyRanch_Tonic_Fireward.description=Sea water and gecko skin. Fire cannot hurt you for two minutes.
items.CozyRanch_Tonic_Swiftness.name=Swiftness Tonic
items.CozyRanch_Tonic_Swiftness.description=A spark of lightning and antelope horn. You move faster for two minutes.
herding_horn.called=You blow the horn and {count} animals come running.
herding_horn.none=You blow the horn, but none of your animals are near enough to hear it.
herding_horn.no_permission=You are not allowed to call animals here.
